Description: Heartbeat sender for Uptime Kuma Push monitors (Termux)
 Sends a heartbeat to an Uptime Kuma Push monitor every minute from a
 supervised termux-services (runit) service, so Uptime Kuma can alert when
 this device stops reporting.
